---
name: architecture
description: The project was changed from React+FastAPI spec to a Python static HTML generator; describes the actual implementation
type: project
---

The original React + FastAPI spec was replaced with a Python static HTML generator on 2026-03-28.

**Why:** User runs reports locally before meetings; no server needed. Simpler to distribute.

**How to apply:** Do not reference backend/, frontend/, FastAPI, or React when working in this repo. The real entry point is `generate_report.py`. All architecture is in `src/`.
